<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18136" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφάντ-αστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαντασία, φύσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					2.304
				</span></i>
			,al.: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ ἀ. τοῦ ὄντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.230
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, κινεῖσθαι,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρμῇ καὶ φαντασίᾳ χρῆσθαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.641
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Gaur.</u>
				7.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>without dreams,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				16.221
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				525
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not sensibly presented,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος,</span> of pure form, <i><span class="en">
				Syrian.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				92.5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
